 "text": "County Services | Coffey County, KS\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nDepartments\nCommunity\nCounty Services\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nBid Opportunities\nDriver's License\nEmployment Opportunities\nMotor Vehicle Registration\nRegister of Deeds\nResource Directory\nTax Search\nHome\nCounty Services\nCounty Services\n9\n1\n1\n2\nBid Opportunities\nAccess bids and request for proposals for consultants, service providers, contractors, vendors, and suppliers.\nDriver's License\nThe County Treasurer's Office handles non-CDL, replacement class C and IDs, address changes, and ID card renewals.\nEmployment Opportunities\nView employment opportunities in Coffey County.\nMotor Vehicle Registration\nLearn how to register your vehicle with the County.\nRegister of Deeds\nThe Coffey County Register of Deeds is a Passport Application Acceptance Agent for the U.S. Department of State.\nResource Directory\nSearch a listing of businesses and organizations that operate in the area.\nTax Search\nSearch for tax information online.\nAgendas & Minutes\nEmergency Notifications\nTax Information\nHealth Information\nCoffey County Lake\nDistrict Court\nGIS Mapping\nSheriff Department\n-->\nContact Us\n110 S. 6th Street\nBurlington, KS 66839-1789\nPhone: 620-364-2191\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nPhotos by Mike Hoag\nHelpful Links\nCalendar\nCounty Commission\nEmployment Opportunities\nSheriff's Office\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.